  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.IPFSOASIS v2.0.4\n\nConnects the OASIS to IPFS -- the content-addressed, peer-to-peer hypermedia protocol for permanent, decentralised data storage. Stores OASIS holons, avatar metadata, and binary assets on IPFS with CID-based addressing ensuring data integrity. Optionally pins to Filecoin for long-term persistence. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.3\n- test(hyperdrive): add real four-provider matrix (d590ad7)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Network/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.IPFSOASIS",
